[ALERT] Over-refund — Gift card #<%= @gift_card.id %>
======================================================

Gift card ID:        #<%= @gift_card.id %> (<%= @gift_card.merchant&.store_name %>)
Load ID:             #<%= @load_id %>
Stripe refund ID:    <%= @refund_id %>
Excess refunded:     <%= @amount_formatted %>

A Stripe refund exceeded what was still unredeemed on this load. The excess
is money that a merchant already received for redemptions — Papayal has
paid it out twice. The load's remaining balance was floored at zero and
the full refund is recorded on the ledger (metadata.over_refund_cents).

View in Stripe: https://dashboard.stripe.com/refunds/<%= @refund_id %>
